// Every slope, angle, equation, intercept, meeting point and distance on the slides, in the notes, tables and plots is computed by
// ln.mjs with exact fractions and checked by a second route; plots draw lines as functions with domains, every marked point lies on
// a drawn line (asserted exactly), labels come from the coordinates and a marked x-intercept is the line's only zero.
